WEBVTT

00:06.589 --> 00:08.424
THIS WORK CONTAINS DEPICTIONS
OF SENSITIVE TOPICS RELATED TO LIFE.

00:08.425 --> 00:10.134
THEY ARE PRESENTED VISUALLY WITH RESPECT
FOR THE INTENT OF THE ORIGINAL WORK,

00:10.135 --> 00:11.343
AND IN NO WAY DO WE ENDORSE SUCH ACTIONS.

00:11.344 --> 00:13.929
THIS IS A BITTERSWEET STORY OF TAKOPI AND
THE KIDS BRAVELY FACING THEIR HARSH FATE.

00:13.930 --> 00:15.932
WE HOPE YOU CAN WATCH IT UNTIL THE END.

00:18.435 --> 00:22.439
TAKOPI'S ORIGINAL SIN

00:33.742 --> 00:36.161
Hey, is anyone in there?

00:38.538 --> 00:39.414
Pi...

00:43.501 --> 00:44.794
What?

01:04.564 --> 01:06.816
I'm hungry-pi.

02:16.886 --> 02:18.762
EPISODE 1: TO YOU IN 2016

02:18.763 --> 02:20.557
<i>I am a Happian.</i>

02:21.182 --> 02:24.269
<i>I'm on a journey to spread happiness
throughout the universe-pi.</i>

02:25.186 --> 02:27.605
<i>Having said farewell
to my hometown, Happy Planet,</i>

02:28.439 --> 02:32.402
<i>I arrived on this green
and blue planet today-pi.</i>

02:33.236 --> 02:35.113
<i>But I almost got caught.</i>

02:35.697 --> 02:38.908
<i>I didn't have anything to eat.
It was really tough-pi.</i>

02:40.118 --> 02:43.413
<i>That's when Shizuka saved me-pi.</i>

02:44.414 --> 02:46.331
Thank you-pi!

02:46.332 --> 02:47.959
The bread's delicious-pi.

02:49.752 --> 02:52.171
So you really are an alien.

02:54.424 --> 02:56.550
What's your name?

02:56.551 --> 02:59.137
I'm Nnu-Anu-Kf.

03:03.266 --> 03:05.560
Nnu-Anu-Kf.

03:07.520 --> 03:10.315
Pi! Shizuka looks very troubled-pi.

03:10.940 --> 03:15.278
But you can call me whatever you want-pi.

03:18.114 --> 03:19.032
Then...

03:20.450 --> 03:21.534
Takopi.

03:23.661 --> 03:25.037
<i>Since Shizuka said so,</i>

03:25.038 --> 03:27.707
<i>I do see the resemblance-pi.</i>

03:29.208 --> 03:33.212
<i>I think Shizuka is a human
called "fourth grader"-pi.</i>

03:34.547 --> 03:37.467
<i>She knows a lot about living things
and she's kind.</i>

03:38.343 --> 03:41.221
<i>When I look at Shizuka, I feel...</i>

03:45.433 --> 03:47.477
Shizuka.

03:48.061 --> 03:50.813
Let me thank you-pi.

03:54.150 --> 03:55.860
Flappy Flappy Wings!

03:56.778 --> 03:58.987
It's one of the Happy Gadgets.

03:58.988 --> 04:02.533
If you use it,
you can fly freely in the air-pi.

04:09.749 --> 04:12.043
Just like this.

04:13.461 --> 04:14.712
How is it-pi?

04:18.091 --> 04:19.591
Here you go.

04:19.592 --> 04:22.262
Now you try it-pi.

04:23.596 --> 04:24.722
I don't need it.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.685
I need to buy a pencil board.

04:29.686 --> 04:30.603
See you.

04:31.646 --> 04:36.317
Also, the bread's leftover from lunch,
so don't worry about it.

04:36.901 --> 04:38.527
I'll give it to you tomorrow too.

04:38.528 --> 04:39.987
Why-pi?

04:39.988 --> 04:42.991
It's clearly very fun-pi.

04:44.325 --> 04:45.660
Because...

04:46.411 --> 04:50.623
even flying in the air
won't change anything.

04:54.836 --> 04:56.087
See you tomorrow.

05:01.342 --> 05:05.013
<i>Maybe Shizuka</i>

05:06.431 --> 05:09.726
<i>has flown in the sky before-pi!</i>

05:10.852 --> 05:14.230
<i>It's true that there are many
flying creatures on this planet-pi.</i>

05:14.897 --> 05:17.065
<i>Humans also blend in with the birds</i>

05:17.066 --> 05:19.193
<i>and practice flying every night.</i>

05:20.069 --> 05:24.364
Shizuka, is this also part
of the training-pi?

05:24.365 --> 05:27.452
No, it's not. Be quiet.

05:28.369 --> 05:30.412
There are people from school here.

05:30.413 --> 05:31.913
If you get caught,
you'll get taken to the health center.

05:31.914 --> 05:33.207
Pi.

05:35.251 --> 05:39.255
<i>It seems "school" is
where Shizuka goes every day-pi.</i>

05:40.798 --> 05:43.633
And then, I did what Marina told me

05:43.634 --> 05:45.720
and snapped off her pencil board.

05:47.555 --> 05:49.639
I can't wait for tomorrow morning.

05:49.640 --> 05:52.434
That's the third one this week.

05:52.435 --> 05:54.394
She'll have to go buy another one.

05:54.395 --> 05:56.897
Do you think she's run out
of her allowance?

05:56.898 --> 05:57.857
No, no.

05:58.441 --> 06:01.319
She can buy it using her welfare money.

06:04.697 --> 06:06.364
They seem to be having fun-pi.

06:06.365 --> 06:08.618
Are they talking about
where to go for fun-pi?

06:10.411 --> 06:11.829
It's not like that.

06:14.665 --> 06:15.917
Oh, right-pi.

06:16.501 --> 06:19.087
You have to let me thank you today-pi.

06:19.754 --> 06:21.672
Today's Happy Gadget is...

06:22.632 --> 06:24.175
Happy Camera!

06:24.884 --> 06:27.135
It looks like an ordinary camera-pi.

06:27.136 --> 06:29.305
But if you take a picture with this-pi,

06:33.684 --> 06:36.562
it'll print this Happy Paper
right away-pi.

06:39.941 --> 06:42.901
But wouldn't it be better
to use a smartphone?

06:42.902 --> 06:44.319
It's quite heavy too.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.237
Pi!

06:45.238 --> 06:48.573
But, but
this camera has a special function.

06:48.574 --> 06:51.409
It's time for me to buy a pencil board.

06:51.410 --> 06:53.161
The stationery store's about to close.

06:53.162 --> 06:55.831
Pi? Are you going to buy it today too-pi?

06:55.832 --> 06:58.751
DIE - IDIOT

07:00.002 --> 07:03.840
Because... I think it's gone again.

07:11.722 --> 07:13.099
See you tomorrow.

07:16.727 --> 07:19.272
<i>Shizuka is very busy-pi.</i>

07:19.939 --> 07:23.818
<i>Even so,
I'll make her happy tomorrow for sure-pi.</i>

07:25.486 --> 07:26.736
SINCE LANDING FROM HAPPY PLANET - DAY 3

07:26.737 --> 07:28.364
Shizuka!

07:29.031 --> 07:32.200
It's a gadget you can use
at events like surprise parties-pi.

07:32.201 --> 07:33.118
See you.

07:33.119 --> 07:34.078
Pi...

07:35.538 --> 07:37.414
DAY 4

07:37.415 --> 07:39.667
xToday's bread is sweet-pi.

07:43.838 --> 07:45.173
Mr. Always Right!

07:45.756 --> 07:49.677
It's a friend gadget that can
always give excellent advice-pi.

07:54.015 --> 07:56.475
Today's gadget is amazing-pi.

07:56.476 --> 07:59.352
It's a ballpoint pen that makes
the sound of a Saturn rabbit.

07:59.353 --> 08:00.395
Takopi.

08:00.396 --> 08:02.314
I have to go home right away today.

08:02.315 --> 08:03.398
See you tomorrow.

08:03.399 --> 08:06.151
Pi? What's wrong-pi?

08:06.152 --> 08:08.279
I have to feed Chappy.

08:09.113 --> 08:10.406
Chappy?

08:15.495 --> 08:16.579
You want to come along?

08:19.749 --> 08:22.001
Pi...

08:23.503 --> 08:24.503
Pi.

08:24.504 --> 08:27.632
<i>So this is Chappy. It's huge-pi.</i>

08:29.926 --> 08:31.968
Okay, okay. I got it.

08:31.969 --> 08:33.304
I know.

08:33.930 --> 08:34.971
I'm home.

08:34.972 --> 08:35.972
I'm home, Chappy.

08:35.973 --> 08:38.726
<i>Shizuka smiled-pi.</i>

08:40.853 --> 08:42.146
Pi!

08:44.774 --> 08:46.651
Don't eat him, okay?

08:49.862 --> 08:52.323
I have to feed it today.

08:53.533 --> 08:54.950
You can come in.

08:54.951 --> 08:55.867
Pi.

08:55.868 --> 08:58.079
My mom has already left for work.

08:59.288 --> 09:01.039
She said she's escorting.

09:01.040 --> 09:04.084
Pi? What does "escorting" mean-pi?

09:04.085 --> 09:06.378
It means entering the shop
together with a customer.

09:06.379 --> 09:07.295
PRODUCE SHOP

09:07.296 --> 09:09.090
<i>Feels like she's really busy.</i>

09:09.674 --> 09:12.093
Huh? Where's your papa?

09:14.845 --> 09:16.389
I don't have a papa.

09:19.976 --> 09:23.311
<i>Humans can have babies
with just the mama-pi?</i>

09:23.312 --> 09:25.147
<i>That's amazing-pi!</i>

09:27.233 --> 09:31.571
Chappy has been with me
since I was very little.

09:32.280 --> 09:34.657
Papa left it behind.

09:35.616 --> 09:38.034
I love Chappy the most.

09:38.035 --> 09:39.286
Pi.

09:39.287 --> 09:43.040
As long as I have Chappy, I'll be fine.

09:43.583 --> 09:45.876
I don't need anything else.

09:47.461 --> 09:49.297
I'll be okay no matter what happens,

09:51.632 --> 09:55.928
no matter how much it hurts
or how hard it is.

09:58.139 --> 09:59.389
You're a bit stinky.

09:59.390 --> 10:01.349
<i>I feel so troubled-pi.</i>

10:01.350 --> 10:03.811
<i>What is this feeling-pi?</i>

10:04.770 --> 10:07.648
<i>What? So she has a papa-pi?</i>

10:09.942 --> 10:12.068
Hey, which one is Happy Planet?

10:12.069 --> 10:15.322
Pi, we can't see it from here-pi.

10:15.323 --> 10:17.325
It's far, far away-pi.

10:17.992 --> 10:21.244
Happy Planet is full of Happy Fruits.

10:21.245 --> 10:23.164
They're super yummy-pi.

10:23.831 --> 10:26.626
You can come visit and play too.

10:27.251 --> 10:28.627
I can't go there.

10:28.628 --> 10:30.587
That's not true-pi.

10:30.588 --> 10:33.089
It's just a short ride
on the Happy Ship-pi.

10:33.090 --> 10:36.092
I don't believe in magic.

10:36.093 --> 10:38.303
It's not magic, it's Happy Gadget--

10:38.304 --> 10:40.473
I can't go anywhere,

10:41.599 --> 10:45.478
whether it's to Happy Planet
or to Papa's side.

10:55.237 --> 10:57.114
<i>My dear child.</i>

10:57.948 --> 11:00.158
Use these Happy Gadgets

11:00.159 --> 11:03.579
to spread happiness
throughout the universe.

11:04.580 --> 11:06.247
But be careful.

11:06.248 --> 11:09.543
Don't ever break the rules.

11:11.629 --> 11:13.922
<i>Mama, forget the rules,</i>

11:13.923 --> 11:18.219
<i>I can't even get her to use the gadgets.</i>

11:19.720 --> 11:20.721
<i>But</i>

11:21.764 --> 11:24.600
<i>I hope Shizuka can smile more-pi.</i>

11:25.851 --> 11:27.143
Shizuka.

11:27.144 --> 11:30.981
Next time, I'll invite you
to Happy Planet-pi.

11:31.565 --> 11:33.858
I've still got lots of Happy Gadgets-pi.

11:33.859 --> 11:36.069
- So--
- Like I said, I don't believe in magic.

11:36.070 --> 11:37.571
So I'll definitely...

11:38.155 --> 11:42.034
make you smile your brightest-pi!

11:48.541 --> 11:52.419
Because of some reason, I can't return
to Happy Planet for a while-pi.

11:52.420 --> 11:54.296
So we can't go right away.

11:55.214 --> 11:56.047
But someday...

11:56.048 --> 11:58.049
Someday, I'll definitely...

11:58.050 --> 11:59.301
Takopi.

12:00.553 --> 12:02.929
Takopi doesn't smell at all.

12:02.930 --> 12:04.140
Pi!

12:04.640 --> 12:05.766
Pi.

12:06.308 --> 12:08.351
I'll get going then.

12:08.352 --> 12:09.437
Shizuka.

12:14.483 --> 12:15.860
See you tomorrow.

12:27.538 --> 12:29.165
Shizuka!

12:30.416 --> 12:32.292
You're here already-pi.

12:32.293 --> 12:33.586
I was waiting for you-pi.

12:34.253 --> 12:36.546
I have a special gadget for you today.

12:36.547 --> 12:37.590
Wait?

12:38.424 --> 12:40.551
There are some marks on your face.

12:41.260 --> 12:43.679
That's the thing around Chappy's neck-pi.

12:45.347 --> 12:47.933
I had a fight with my friend.

12:48.934 --> 12:52.604
So after humans fight,
their face color changes-pi.

12:52.605 --> 12:55.773
My face also turns red
when I'm embarrassed-pi.

12:55.774 --> 12:57.358
Oh, right. If that's the case,

12:57.359 --> 12:59.445
I have the perfect Happy Gadget for this.

13:00.154 --> 13:01.738
Patch-Up Ribbon!

13:01.739 --> 13:03.199
How about this-pi?

13:03.866 --> 13:07.660
If you tie this ribbon
around your pinky and your friend's,

13:07.661 --> 13:09.830
you'll be able to make up right away-pi.

13:11.248 --> 13:14.542
And the ribbon is sturdy,
so it can stretch infinitely.

13:14.543 --> 13:17.421
Even if your friend is far away,
you don't have to worry-pi.

13:20.299 --> 13:21.759
That's nice.

13:23.302 --> 13:25.095
I want to use that.

13:26.847 --> 13:29.390
Really-pi? Then let's hurry up

13:29.391 --> 13:32.977
- and tie this on your friend's pinky...
- I want to do it slowly by myself.

13:32.978 --> 13:34.563
Can I borrow it?

13:36.565 --> 13:39.235
<i>Rules of Happy Gadgets:</i>

13:40.152 --> 13:41.986
<i>One must always use a gadget</i>

13:41.987 --> 13:46.075
<i>in front of a Happian.</i>

13:47.034 --> 13:51.413
<i>Never hand over a gadget to an alien.</i>

13:51.914 --> 13:55.084
Please, Takopi.

13:57.211 --> 13:59.880
<i>But it's Shizuka's request-pi.</i>

14:00.923 --> 14:01.839
I'll lend it to you-pi.

14:01.840 --> 14:05.636
If you have any questions,
you can ask me anytime-pi.

14:06.136 --> 14:07.012
Got it.

14:07.721 --> 14:10.933
I hope you can make up
with your friend-pi.

14:15.604 --> 14:16.813
Bye-bye.

14:16.814 --> 14:20.568
SOUTH MUNICIPAL PARK

14:24.196 --> 14:28.492
<i>Since it's Shizuka,
I don't think I'll have to worry-pi.</i>

14:38.127 --> 14:39.879
<i>I don't have to worry-pi.</i>

14:46.176 --> 14:49.430
<i>I'm starting to get a little worried-pi.</i>

14:56.604 --> 14:58.063
<i>Just a little worried.</i>

15:00.274 --> 15:03.527
<i>It's not that I'm curious
if they made up-pi.</i>

15:04.445 --> 15:06.237
<i>Because the ribbon can stretch infinitely,</i>

15:06.238 --> 15:08.908
<i>it often gets tangled up-pi.</i>

15:09.617 --> 15:10.450
<i>If that happens,</i>

15:10.451 --> 15:12.912
<i>it's hard for one person to untangle it.</i>

15:13.746 --> 15:16.040
I've got to help her.

15:17.750 --> 15:19.501
Shizuka!

15:48.072 --> 15:51.492
Shizuka? What are you doing-pi?

15:52.242 --> 15:56.455
Tying that ribbon
to the beam won't work-pi.

15:57.915 --> 16:00.709
I'll explain how to use it again-pi.

16:01.293 --> 16:04.295
It's okay, you can come down now-pi.

16:04.296 --> 16:05.422
Shizuka.

16:07.383 --> 16:08.425
Shizuka?

16:09.385 --> 16:11.178
Shizuka. Shizuka--

16:25.317 --> 16:26.777
<i>She's dead?</i>

16:27.319 --> 16:28.779
<i>Why?</i>

16:30.698 --> 16:32.658
<i>Why?</i>

16:34.243 --> 16:35.744
<i>Why is she dead?</i>

16:36.453 --> 16:38.831
<i>Shizuka is dead-pi.</i>

16:39.331 --> 16:41.250
<i>The ribbon wrapped around her neck...</i>

16:42.251 --> 16:43.669
<i>is my ribbon-pi.</i>

16:44.211 --> 16:46.714
<i>A ribbon that's supposed
to patch things up.</i>

16:47.297 --> 16:49.133
<i>Never hand over...</i>

16:50.801 --> 16:52.720
<i>a gadget to an alien.</i>

16:57.307 --> 17:01.186
<i>This is all because I broke the rules.</i>

17:28.505 --> 17:32.468
Shizuka, I'm sorry.

17:35.220 --> 17:36.805
I'm so sorry.

17:44.104 --> 17:46.147
<i>In this vast universe,</i>

17:46.148 --> 17:49.150
<i>death is the one law
that applies equally to all.</i>

17:49.151 --> 17:51.612
<i>Nothing can overturn it.</i>

17:53.405 --> 17:56.115
<i>No matter how clever a gadget is,</i>

17:56.116 --> 17:58.827
<i>it can't bring the dead back to life.</i>

18:04.166 --> 18:05.334
<i>But...</i>

18:08.128 --> 18:10.755
<i>If you take a picture with this-pi,</i>

18:10.756 --> 18:14.343
<i>it'll print this Happy Paper
right away-pi.</i>

18:14.927 --> 18:17.554
But wouldn't it be better
to use a smartphone?

18:18.514 --> 18:20.473
<i>But Shizuka,</i>

18:20.474 --> 18:23.393
<i>this camera has a special function-pi.</i>

18:24.728 --> 18:26.063
<i>The space-time camera function.</i>

18:27.272 --> 18:30.109
<i>It can only store one photo-pi.</i>

18:30.943 --> 18:33.111
<i>But if you use the camera to read it,</i>

18:33.112 --> 18:36.698
<i>you can go back to the moment
that photo was taken.</i>

18:41.954 --> 18:44.331
<i>It's been seven days
since I landed here from Happy Planet.</i>

18:45.040 --> 18:48.085
<i>On the third planet
in the solar system, "Earth."</i>

18:49.503 --> 18:51.922
<i>Intelligent life form, "human."</i>

18:53.257 --> 18:56.509
<i>In your language, "taking one's own life"</i>

18:56.510 --> 18:58.762
<i>is called "suicide."</i>

18:59.972 --> 19:02.307
<i>Why does this kind of behavior exist?</i>

19:03.267 --> 19:06.103
<i>Why did you want to commit suicide?</i>

19:06.895 --> 19:08.605
<i>I don't know.</i>

19:10.357 --> 19:13.485
<i>But because I don't know,
I want to ask you-pi.</i>

19:14.570 --> 19:18.031
<i>I want to talk to you more
and get to know you better.</i>

19:18.615 --> 19:23.453
<i>Together, we'll figure out a future
where you don't have to die-pi.</i>

19:24.371 --> 19:28.959
<i>Shizuka, for a tomorrow
where you can smile.</i>

19:39.428 --> 19:40.554
Takopi?

19:42.389 --> 19:44.223
Why did you suddenly space out?

19:44.224 --> 19:46.727
You were frozen
with the camera in your hands.

19:49.104 --> 19:50.189
Hey.

19:54.026 --> 19:55.194
Pi.

19:56.528 --> 19:59.614
Oh, right. The camera-pi.

19:59.615 --> 20:01.200
I took the photo-pi.

20:06.288 --> 20:07.497
Takopi?

20:08.457 --> 20:10.666
It's nothing-pi.

20:10.667 --> 20:12.084
Is that so?

20:12.085 --> 20:14.253
It's time for me to buy a pencil board.

20:14.254 --> 20:15.213
Pi?

20:15.214 --> 20:17.298
The stationery store's about to close.

20:17.299 --> 20:19.092
- I'll get going then.
- Wait-pi!

20:19.676 --> 20:20.594
Pi.

20:21.803 --> 20:25.057
<i>I need to know more about Shizuka-pi.</i>

20:25.807 --> 20:28.768
<i>First, the place Shizuka goes
to every day.</i>

20:28.769 --> 20:30.479
<i>I remember the name is...</i>

20:31.813 --> 20:34.775
Shizuka! From tomorrow onwards,

20:36.526 --> 20:37.360
please

20:37.361 --> 20:38.361
<i>take me</i>

20:38.362 --> 20:41.281
to "school" with you-pi!

20:45.911 --> 20:47.286
DIE!

20:47.287 --> 20:48.914
<i>This is school.</i>

20:49.414 --> 20:52.459
<i>I think I can learn
more about Shizuka here.</i>

20:54.294 --> 20:55.336
Hey!

20:55.337 --> 20:57.672
Good morning, Parasite.

20:57.673 --> 20:58.590
<i>Marina.</i>

20:59.258 --> 21:01.550
<i>It's the girl I saw at the park before-pi.</i>

21:01.551 --> 21:03.595
<i>What does parasite mean-pi?</i>

21:05.055 --> 21:07.348
- You stink again today.
- Pi!

21:07.349 --> 21:09.768
You smell just like that gutter dog.

21:10.727 --> 21:14.273
Shi-Shizuka, it's okay.

21:14.982 --> 21:16.399
School?

21:16.400 --> 21:17.400
You can come if you want.

21:17.401 --> 21:19.610
But if you get caught,
you'll be taken to the health center.

21:19.611 --> 21:21.613
Pi, if that's the case,

21:22.281 --> 21:23.365
Flower Pin!

21:24.157 --> 21:25.658
If I stick this on my head,

21:25.659 --> 21:29.287
everyone else will see me
as a Happy Flower-pi.

21:29.288 --> 21:30.831
Happy Flower...

21:35.210 --> 21:38.671
Why do you have
a chameleon plant in your hair?

21:38.672 --> 21:39.755
That's weird!

21:39.756 --> 21:41.216
You're so lame.

21:47.264 --> 21:49.683
Class is starting,
so go back to your seat.

21:50.350 --> 21:51.434
<i>Anyway,</i>

21:51.435 --> 21:54.854
<i>I need to know how Shizuka
is doing at school-pi.</i>

21:54.855 --> 21:57.733
<i>Maybe I'll find out why she died
in the process.</i>

22:02.237 --> 22:03.863
This question...

22:03.864 --> 22:05.324
Kuze, you answer it.

22:07.075 --> 22:08.409
Teacher.

22:08.410 --> 22:11.163
Kuze said she forgot
to bring her homework.

22:12.914 --> 22:14.916
No, it's my notebook...

22:15.709 --> 22:17.418
I see, you forgot about it.

22:17.419 --> 22:18.920
Then let's have Azuma answer.

22:27.554 --> 22:29.096
<i>I got it-pi.</i>

22:29.097 --> 22:33.685
<i>Shizuka must have died because she was
sad about forgetting her homework-pi.</i>

22:36.021 --> 22:37.439
<i>Leave it to me then!</i>

22:41.193 --> 22:42.693
- Takopi?
- Shizuka.

22:42.694 --> 22:46.323
The answer to tomorrow's homework
is 35 for Question One.

22:47.032 --> 22:49.366
Question Two is 162.

22:49.367 --> 22:50.660
That's correct.

22:52.037 --> 22:53.330
Well then, the next question.

22:53.914 --> 22:55.372
Kirarazaka.

22:55.373 --> 22:57.333
Well...

22:57.334 --> 22:59.419
What's wrong? Did you forget to bring it?

22:59.961 --> 23:01.338
Then let's have Azuma answer.

23:07.385 --> 23:09.887
It's lunchtime.

23:09.888 --> 23:12.056
Aren't you ashamed of always leaving
so much food behind?

23:12.057 --> 23:15.267
I'm impressed that you don't feel guilty.

23:15.268 --> 23:16.937
After all, you didn't even pay
your lunch fees.

23:17.687 --> 23:19.189
<i>Huh? Again-pi?</i>

23:20.398 --> 23:22.650
<i>Shizuka was so sad
about not finishing her school lunch...</i>

23:22.651 --> 23:24.444
<i>that's why she died.</i>

23:25.278 --> 23:26.196
<i>In that case...</i>

23:26.822 --> 23:28.907
- Shizuka!
- Takopi.

23:29.699 --> 23:31.493
Leave it to me-pi!

23:47.801 --> 23:51.887
Did she eat the corn cob too?

23:51.888 --> 23:53.306
Scary.

23:54.432 --> 23:56.810
<i>It's okay now-pi.</i>

24:26.089 --> 24:27.382
DIE, YOU FILTHY THING

24:31.136 --> 24:34.264
SHIZUKA KUZE

25:10.175 --> 25:12.302
<i>Huh? Don't tell me this is...</i>

25:13.887 --> 25:15.305
Could it be that...

25:17.599 --> 25:20.352
Shizuka and Marina are fighting-pi?

25:24.689 --> 25:26.857
<i>When Happians fight,</i>

25:26.858 --> 25:29.319
<i>they hide each other's Happy Paper-pi.</i>

25:30.111 --> 25:32.529
<i>To put it bluntly, it's an attempt</i>

25:32.530 --> 25:34.324
<i>to get the other person's attention
and make up.</i>

25:35.283 --> 25:38.578
<i>It's the same thing
as Marina hiding your notebook-pi.</i>

25:39.746 --> 25:43.083
<i>She stares at Shizuka all the time</i>

25:43.917 --> 25:45.752
<i>also because she wants to patch things up!</i>

25:48.338 --> 25:50.340
Was that a fight?

25:52.342 --> 25:53.759
I guess so.

25:53.760 --> 25:55.804
<i>I knew it-pi.</i>

25:57.305 --> 26:00.058
<i>If that's the case,
they have to make up as soon as possible.</i>

26:01.059 --> 26:03.143
There you are, Kuze.

26:03.144 --> 26:05.312
Marina wants to talk to you.

26:05.313 --> 26:07.857
She's waiting for you
in the gym storage during lunchtime.

26:10.235 --> 26:12.279
<i>This is your chance-pi!</i>

26:15.824 --> 26:17.284
Shizuka, Shizuka.

26:17.867 --> 26:19.576
Aren't you going-pi?

26:19.577 --> 26:21.288
Marina's waiting for you-pi.

26:22.664 --> 26:23.873
I'm going.

26:24.582 --> 26:26.376
I'll be going there soon.

26:27.002 --> 26:30.630
The secret to making up is
to have a good conversation-pi.

26:31.881 --> 26:34.718
Because talking brings happiness-pi.

26:35.677 --> 26:38.930
You're only saying that

26:39.514 --> 26:41.141
because you've never talked to Marina.

26:41.808 --> 26:42.975
Pi?

26:42.976 --> 26:44.894
That's not true... Pi!

26:48.815 --> 26:52.651
<i>Did they get into a big fight-pi?</i>

26:52.652 --> 26:55.363
<i>Like eating each other's
Happy Pudding without permission?</i>

26:56.156 --> 26:58.491
<i>But they have to make up.</i>

26:59.117 --> 27:00.118
<i>Pi.</i>

27:01.619 --> 27:02.746
<i>In that case...</i>

27:07.334 --> 27:08.793
Transformation Palette!

27:09.586 --> 27:11.378
If I put a part of Shizuka's body in here

27:11.379 --> 27:12.881
and press the switch...

27:21.389 --> 27:24.184
I'll transform into you-pi.

27:26.144 --> 27:28.062
Shizuka, wait in the restroom.

27:28.063 --> 27:30.607
I'll go talk to her-pi.

27:32.442 --> 27:36.154
<i>I'll help them make up in her place.</i>

27:37.405 --> 27:39.115
You're late.

27:39.866 --> 27:41.325
<i>Even if they're in a big fight,</i>

27:41.326 --> 27:43.869
<i>as long as they talk it through, I'm sure...</i>

27:43.870 --> 27:45.871
Sorry... Sorry-pi.

27:45.872 --> 27:49.208
Why are you talking like that?
It's so weird.

27:49.209 --> 27:51.502
Hey, Marina.

27:51.503 --> 27:54.089
I wanted to talk to you too...

28:04.224 --> 28:07.101
I'm saying the way you talk is disgusting.

28:07.102 --> 28:08.603
Stop talking like that.

28:10.605 --> 28:11.564
I'm sorry-pi.

28:15.944 --> 28:17.319
Did you suddenly become an anime nerd?

28:17.320 --> 28:19.571
What's with the "boku" and "pi"?

28:19.572 --> 28:21.240
I already know that you're disgusting.

28:21.241 --> 28:22.575
I don't like it, so stop.

28:23.868 --> 28:27.287
- I-I'm sorry.
- So, what I want to say is,

28:27.288 --> 28:29.957
aren't you being too arrogant lately?

28:29.958 --> 28:32.335
- School lunch, for example.
<i>- Huh?</i>

28:33.253 --> 28:34.962
<i>- This isn't talking...</i>
- You've never paid your taxes.

28:34.963 --> 28:37.047
<i>- My cheek feels hot-pi.</i>
- And homework,

28:37.048 --> 28:38.507
<i>- At Happy Planet,</i>
- you answered so confidently.

28:38.508 --> 28:41.845
<i>- we never touch each other that hard-pi.</i>
- Are you trying to act smart?

28:42.429 --> 28:43.930
<i>I can't stand-pi.</i>

28:44.556 --> 28:46.391
<i>I feel like I'm going to cry.</i>

28:47.642 --> 28:49.060
<i>- Huh?</i>
- What?

28:51.521 --> 28:52.647
- Nothing--
- <i>I'm scared.</i>

28:56.025 --> 28:58.528
Listen to what I'm saying.

29:00.029 --> 29:02.657
Marina, well...

29:05.577 --> 29:07.662
Don't call my name so casually.

29:09.539 --> 29:11.666
I'll catch your whore germs.

29:17.714 --> 29:18.840
<i>I'm scared.</i>

29:19.382 --> 29:21.968
<i>She's so scary.</i>

29:22.635 --> 29:24.428
<i>It hurts.</i>

29:24.429 --> 29:26.597
<i>I can't speak-pi.</i>

29:26.598 --> 29:28.682
<i>It's painful and I want to cry.</i>

29:28.683 --> 29:29.934
<i>I want to run away.</i>

29:39.277 --> 29:40.487
<i>But...</i>

29:41.780 --> 29:43.198
Marina!

29:44.282 --> 29:49.162
Listen, I don't know
why you're doing this.

29:49.996 --> 29:52.623
But I'm sure we can understand
each other if we talk it out.

29:52.624 --> 29:55.460
- So--
- You have no right to say that.

29:56.878 --> 29:58.797
You piece of human scum.

30:01.007 --> 30:02.424
That hurts!

30:02.425 --> 30:05.886
You're the daughter of a whore
who leeches off men.

30:05.887 --> 30:08.514
If you've got time
to talk all high and mighty,

30:08.515 --> 30:10.517
then give me back my dad!

30:13.269 --> 30:16.063
Marina, wait... pi.

30:16.064 --> 30:19.733
I told you not to talk like that!

30:19.734 --> 30:21.068
<i>This...</i>

30:21.069 --> 30:22.362
<i>won't work!</i>

30:24.823 --> 30:26.074
<i>Takopi?</i>

30:34.207 --> 30:36.708
The answer to tomorrow's homework is...

30:36.709 --> 30:38.670
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

30:40.588 --> 30:44.634
<i>Why did Marina do that-pi?</i>

30:46.052 --> 30:47.553
<i>That's right. I remember...</i>

30:47.554 --> 30:50.597
<i>Aren't you being too arrogant lately?</i>

30:50.598 --> 30:51.766
<i>School lunch, for example.</i>

30:53.810 --> 30:54.977
<i>And homework,</i>

30:54.978 --> 30:57.272
<i>you answered so confidently.</i>

30:57.856 --> 30:58.981
<i>Huh?</i>

30:58.982 --> 31:00.733
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

31:02.193 --> 31:04.487
Question Two is 162.

31:08.867 --> 31:10.869
<i>...it was my fault-pi?</i>

31:14.122 --> 31:16.958
Well, I'm going to see her now.

31:26.801 --> 31:29.804
<i>Shizuka is suffering because of me.</i>

31:30.930 --> 31:33.808
<i>Looks like I should go in her place.</i>

31:35.685 --> 31:38.479
<i>Maybe they can make up this time.</i>

31:39.063 --> 31:40.856
<i>Hurry up and go-pi.</i>

31:40.857 --> 31:42.025
<i>Move it-pi.</i>

31:54.704 --> 31:57.707
<i>I'm too scared to take a single step-pi.</i>

31:58.416 --> 32:01.209
<i>I want to help Shizuka.</i>

32:01.210 --> 32:03.129
<i>I want to take her place.</i>

32:03.630 --> 32:06.257
<i>It's all because I'm a coward.</i>

32:10.762 --> 32:11.804
<i>But...</i>

32:22.273 --> 32:23.107
Teacher!

32:23.942 --> 32:25.943
Teacher! Someone, please!

32:25.944 --> 32:27.904
Go to the gym storage!

32:28.404 --> 32:31.157
Help!

32:33.660 --> 32:37.163
If there's anything I can do to help,
just let me know.

32:39.415 --> 32:40.540
Azuma.

32:40.541 --> 32:43.585
Do you want to talk about it
at the next class meeting?

32:43.586 --> 32:45.838
It's next Wednesday.

32:47.715 --> 32:50.717
I'm really fine. I'll get going.

32:50.718 --> 32:53.179
Why don't you talk to the other teachers?

32:53.888 --> 32:55.973
Like the PE teacher, Mr. Hodoya.

32:55.974 --> 32:58.725
I often see him at the student council.

32:58.726 --> 33:00.143
That person's a bit scary--

33:00.144 --> 33:02.187
It won't change anything.

33:02.188 --> 33:03.147
See you.

33:06.776 --> 33:07.860
See you.

33:20.623 --> 33:23.084
Is it okay to just ignore
that boy from earlier?

33:24.377 --> 33:26.212
I see-pi.

33:34.762 --> 33:35.971
Shizuka, I'm so--

33:35.972 --> 33:38.391
You saved me, didn't you?

33:39.559 --> 33:41.477
The teacher thought it was strange.

33:41.978 --> 33:43.395
Kuze was the one who asked for help,

33:43.396 --> 33:45.773
but she was the one who got beaten up.

33:47.442 --> 33:49.985
Thanks to you, I only got hurt on my face.

33:49.986 --> 33:53.071
Pi, Sizuka but...

33:53.072 --> 33:53.990
Other than that,

33:55.241 --> 33:57.743
you helped me a lot too, right?

33:57.744 --> 33:59.829
You knew the answers to my homework

34:00.329 --> 34:01.788
and helped with the school lunch.

34:01.789 --> 34:03.541
And my missing notebook
turned up on its own.

34:04.459 --> 34:05.667
No-pi.

34:05.668 --> 34:10.256
Those are the reasons
why you had such a hard time today-pi.

34:10.965 --> 34:12.716
Well, school...

34:12.717 --> 34:16.970
Ever since Marina's dad
and my mom got close,

34:16.971 --> 34:18.765
it's been like this.

34:19.766 --> 34:22.017
<i>All I do is cower and watch
from the sidelines.</i>

34:22.018 --> 34:24.270
<i>I can't do anything.</i>

34:24.937 --> 34:25.772
Shizuka.

34:26.606 --> 34:28.399
Going to school isn't fun at all.

34:29.067 --> 34:30.485
I have to face Marina,

34:31.027 --> 34:33.946
and it's full of awful things.

34:35.698 --> 34:36.532
But...

34:39.619 --> 34:42.163
I think things have
been pretty good lately.

34:46.501 --> 34:49.420
Shizuka, I'm sorry.

34:51.714 --> 34:53.841
<i>I know I'm very useless-pi,</i>

34:54.717 --> 34:57.220
<i>but I'll continue to help you
from now on-pi.</i>

34:59.138 --> 35:03.059
<i>I'll definitely make sure you don't die.</i>

35:10.650 --> 35:11.984
<i>Die!</i>

35:13.945 --> 35:16.613
I failed to bully her after school
ten times in a row.

35:16.614 --> 35:17.824
I can't believe it!

35:19.367 --> 35:21.452
What's wrong with her this week?

35:23.538 --> 35:25.164
<i>Such a cocky...</i>

35:36.717 --> 35:40.888
Papa's having dinner with that woman.

35:42.932 --> 35:48.521
If only you could come home earlier.

35:49.230 --> 35:52.525
I got scolded alone again.

35:53.776 --> 35:58.030
Mari, you're on my side, aren't you?

36:00.700 --> 36:04.704
You'll let Mama get things
off her chest, right?

36:05.788 --> 36:07.248
Pi...
